  "term": "encounter",
  "definition": "In this educational psychology context, an encounter refers to coming across AI-generated information unexpectedly and without planning while interacting with an AI system. It includes unanticipated recommendations, discoveries during assisted searching, or extra information that goes beyond the user’s original question.",
